{"2334330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CASSETTE BOY", "steam_appid": 2334330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4440800], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>“Does the moon cease to exist when I’m not looking?”</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASSETTE BOY was inspired by a question from quantum mechanics and lets you explore a world where what isn’t seen… doesn’t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this strange world that changes with your perspective, pursue the secrets of the missing moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world that seems 2D, yet hides a 3D reality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, it seems like a 2D pixel-art world, but it’s actually a fully 3D structure.<br>Rotate the map to discover new surprises. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/b1e33370e6a5458ed09e1ba64a8a7c4e.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/b1e33370e6a5458ed09e1ba64a8a7c4e.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/b1e33370e6a5458ed09e1ba64a8a7c4e.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A puzzle that plays with what you see</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, things that aren’t visible simply don’t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your perspective, move obstacles out of sight, uncover hidden paths, and solve puzzles as you journey forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/55df9791d84b2cd98725d0523cd8f94a.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/55df9791d84b2cd98725d0523cd8f94a.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/55df9791d84b2cd98725d0523cd8f94a.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-packed gameplay and boss battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, take up sword and bow to face monsters and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/fc7f9066237e01d5532fe36a98ee5004.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/fc7f9066237e01d5532fe36a98ee5004.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/fc7f9066237e01d5532fe36a98ee5004.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters full of personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet mysterious characters in this curious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their stories and conversations bring depth, charm, and joy to your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/632836b094acd234fa73bc106e32c458.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/632836b094acd234fa73bc106e32c458.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/632836b094acd234fa73bc106e32c458.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear up for a bigger adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new weapons and equipment to expand your options in exploration and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/90d2a299b4f734bed011f988d678e35b.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/90d2a299b4f734bed011f988d678e35b.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/90d2a299b4f734bed011f988d678e35b.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Perspective-based puzzles where unseen things don’t exist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A variety of puzzles and tricks triggered by rotating your viewpoint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A gameplay experience that blends puzzles, exploration, and action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A puzzle adventure that feels familiar yet refreshingly new</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>“Does the moon cease to exist when I’m not looking?”</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASSETTE BOY was inspired by a question from quantum mechanics and lets you explore a world where what isn’t seen… doesn’t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this strange world that changes with your perspective, pursue the secrets of the missing moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world that seems 2D, yet hides a 3D reality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, it seems like a 2D pixel-art world, but it’s actually a fully 3D structure.<br>Rotate the map to discover new surprises. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/b1e33370e6a5458ed09e1ba64a8a7c4e.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/b1e33370e6a5458ed09e1ba64a8a7c4e.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/b1e33370e6a5458ed09e1ba64a8a7c4e.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A puzzle that plays with what you see</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, things that aren’t visible simply don’t exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your perspective, move obstacles out of sight, uncover hidden paths, and solve puzzles as you journey forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/55df9791d84b2cd98725d0523cd8f94a.poster.avif?t=1787906691\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/55df9791d84b2cd98725d0523cd8f94a.webm?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334330/extras/55df9791d84b2cd98725d0523cd8f94a.mp4?t=1787906691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action-packed gameplay and boss battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >